OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJohn Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but     
OL,4,Astill unbroken as freezing weather sets
OL,5,Ain                                     
OL,7,FAside from little things like that,    
OL,8,Fthough, Kyiv seems fairly normal at    
OL,9,Ffirst sight. You become well aware     
OL,10,Fthere's a war on when sirens begin to  
OL,11,Fwail and people check their phones for 
OL,12,Fthe notifications which tell them      
OL,13,Fthere's a red alert and missiles are on
OL,14,Ftheir way. You can even buy gadgets    
OL,15,Fthat show you which direction the      
OL,16,Fdrones are coming from, and what type  
OL,17,Fthey are.                              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
