OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJohn Simpson: Ukraine is bowed but     
OL,4,Astill unbroken as freezing weather sets
OL,5,Ain                                     
OL,7,FThe drones and ballistic missiles have 
OL,8,Fbeen hitting in sizeable numbers over  
OL,9,Fthe last couple of weeks. On the       
OL,10,Fmorning of Monday 16 November, the     
OL,11,Fbattle of the bridges began. Ukraine   
OL,12,Fhit the Kerch bridge which links Russia
OL,13,Fto illegally occupied Crimea. Then it  
OL,14,Flaunched a bigger wave of missiles and 
OL,15,Fdrones, damaging the central           
OL,16,Froad-bridge arch. A few hours later,   
OL,17,Fpresumably in revenge, Russia fired    
OL,18,Fseven ballistic missiles at Kyiv,      
OL,19,Fdisabling two of the nine bridges that 
OL,20,Fcross the River Dnipro.                
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
